#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:5
#: 31c07aeb75954baa88ccce84e2fa683f 5bc7e2f1e65c486e821e3df873d4de04
#: 9318939334964ba4aec37687afd1b6d3 da2fcad757414030b92783748909262e
#: f3b69ab7a6534dd583524e06fefc15da
msgid "Camera Triggering using Seagull MAP-X2"
msgstr "使用 Seagull MAP-X2 触发相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:10
#: 249401e6a03542f984fa54679856e0e2
msgid ""
"The `Seagull MAP-X2 <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-map-x2/>`__ "
"is a precision camera shutter trigger and logger. It can be connected to "
"Pixhawk or other ArduPilot compatible autopilot in order to automate camera "
"shutter triggering and log the precise co-ordinates of each photo for "
"geotagging purposes."
msgstr ""
"`Seagull MAP-X2 <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-map-x2/>`__ "
"是一款精密相机快门触发器和记录仪。它可连接到 Pixhawk 或其他兼容 ArduPilot "
"的飞控，以自动化相机快门触发，并记录每张照片的精确坐标用于地理标记。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:12
#: 1baaa465de8f4ddfbfb80e80bcae340e 294a65b9d1f244e5b57f8a87db0d3cbd
#: 5dfe77a38d5449929b30ca8c98f8abdc d32e3c5801e5447ca150181cbc18a2cf
#: f40d8506cb9b4fd9bc992705d0821c18
msgid ""
"The current list of compatible cameras can be found on `Seagull Cable Finder"
" <https://www.seagulluav.com/map-cable-finder/>`__."
msgstr ""
"当前兼容相机列表可在 `Seagull Cable Finder <https://www.seagulluav.com/map-cable-"
"finder/>`__ 上找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:14
#: 276581c107874f0786292ebe8ac38841 51e0b77d2d154843b518a966a47cd348
#: 53b3b1b13ac642e6b58c2a84b24ff2c5 77f98c96afe7424fa3d3308a1b1bc488
#: 816323af10464a54a6be6efdedf3c865
msgid ""
"Seagull MAP-X2 utilizes event based logging for extra precision if used with"
" the `Seagull SYNC2 Hot Shoe Adapter "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-sync2/>`__"
msgstr ""
"Seagull MAP-X2 在与 `Seagull SYNC2 Hot Shoe Adapter "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-sync2/>`__ "
"配合使用时，支持基于事件的记录以获得更高精度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:16
#: 1ca117605fea449da7d757296fea0ba4 5092f78b025148c68a352ef959d41112
#: 51859e57c6f145539c884a9cfb20c200 8702fe6460da4a2e840c0ca07ad59451
#: b4697da462a14b12bf97e0c2844259e2
msgid "The board supports 4 shutter trigger modes:"
msgstr "该板支持 4 种快门触发模式："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:18
#: 4391822e81ea4e8195b844e5fe055caa 746a7ac3d49e4fa1aebf2f9372e113fe
#: 7dbec3535b76490fb4c057323f91fe5e d69e5aee1e2741528d5cff685ebf05a1
#: fb2eec2bd0734c1ba665ccd6978055b5
msgid ""
"**ACT** (\"AutoCustomTrigger\") : user is able to define required focus time"
" and then trigger"
msgstr "**ACT** （「AutoCustomTrigger」）：用户可自定义所需对焦时间，然后触发"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:19
#: 5a7b71d2b3d3407f8828b1633d8880be
msgid ""
"**PWM** : fully customisable PWM trigger for cameras that utilze PWM "
"triggering"
msgstr "**PWM**：完全可自定义的 PWM 触发，适用于使用 PWM 触发的相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:20
#: 02c7d74bf9eb4efdbad7766c1288138e 2790d4ee56b84af28adf1dee25b9cae7
#: 6c09e2174c224f8cac3aca21c7ba8e5d 79a638a6e62c47e2a351656e86d77618
#: b3b7f2ac8df34555bf18423e32ea236c
msgid "**SST** : read event signal then trigger"
msgstr "**SST**：读取事件信号后触发"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:21
#: 33705c32c377469a88f4235362cb5857 43ccdef8fb1e44149e49414623173d22
#: 980c3a7fd30141d1a706f0e75769b9bc cd9f99ff07b14b9a8137d47b62767f15
#: dc0e6fbf39924bc8ad2ee4e501dd8b30
msgid "**Timelapse** : user defined interval triggering"
msgstr "**Timelapse**：用户自定义间隔触发"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:23
#: 0f8d011633e54367bce47eb4b9f268fa 1ecbbf0ec21b48b4bd709c07c3de079e
#: 6b5b16a3f8664819b258b5b7c27fb769 84c840f8352149af8713fff35293ad35
#: 8bd30c8dd7274093aa1407509e02076b
msgid ""
"Seagull MAP-X2 also supports **\"Camera ON/OFF\"** - which is exclusive to "
"**Sony MULTI** cameras."
msgstr "Seagull MAP-X2 还支持 **「Camera ON/OFF」** ——仅限 **Sony MULTI** 相机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:25
#: 393f86ee17484152b6d3f8e0459f0aa3 3d2f2f1c97f64581b8d2c98a85605646
#: 44852d76a71349d9931834350ef3bfdf 598a41dfaa1845699c8378df2735ed1a
#: dfd4d9bc03ca487eb1995071eaa729e2
msgid ""
"More detailed instructions on how to setup MAP-X2 are provided in the "
"`Seagull MAP-X2 Manual "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/manuals/Seagull_MAP-X2-Manual.pdf>`__ as well as"
" `Seagull MAP-X2 Support <https://www.seagulluav.com/seagull-"
"map-x2-support/>`__ page."
msgstr ""
"关于如何设置 MAP-X2 的详细说明，请参阅 `Seagull MAP-X2 Manual "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/manuals/Seagull_MAP-X2-Manual.pdf>`__ 以及 "
"`Seagull MAP-X2 Support <https://www.seagulluav.com/seagull-"
"map-x2-support/>`__ 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:10
#: 139c538309fb4353abac462722a546d1 2f4d4a81c7604bb4a66ae4311b474d02
#: 996463cbaade4cdeb5479ca8644f5e69 c7c6e21ef60348fca8790ab8f7f91572
msgid ""
"The `Seagull MAP-X2 <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-map-x2/>`__ "
"is a precision camera shutter trigger and logger. It can be connected to "
"Pixhawk or other ArduPilot compatible autopilot in order to automate camera "
"shutter triggering and log the precise coordinates of each photo for "
"geotagging purposes."
msgstr ""
"`Seagull MAP-X2 <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-map-x2/>`__ "
"是一款精密相机快门触发与记录设备。它可以连接到 Pixhawk 或其他兼容 ArduPilot "
"的飞控，用于自动触发相机快门，并记录每张照片的精确坐标，供地理标记（geotagging）使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-mapx2.rst:19
#: 329e0b28d83044ce8b4c6c22aeaeda42 6f8db317226541088a69e5065fe9819a
#: 99cf81a03570466db57ee2e0589447ab aefdc00cd337469bbad46c87a53cc886
msgid ""
"**PWM** : fully customisable PWM trigger for cameras that utilize PWM "
"triggering"
msgstr "**PWM**：完全可定制的 PWM 触发，适用于采用 PWM 触发方式的相机"
